{"screen_name": "amaruma", "file": "amaruma", "name": "Ama🍄illustrator", "avatar_url": "https://proxy.misskeyusercontent.jp/avatar.webp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.misskeyusercontent.jp%2Fio%2Ff0ccecf0-fa8f-4678-acc2-be1c468ee86a.png&avatar=1", "header_url": "https://media.misskeyusercontent.jp/io/65862e95-e532-443b-a4dc-9e1bd2c5429d.webp", "description": "illustration/original art\nEN/日本語OK\nchuitake46@gmail.com", "total_works": 13, "scraped_works": 13, "first_seen": "2026-03-20T10:24:29.897751+00:00", "last_updated": "2026-03-20T10:24:29.897751+00:00", "price_history": {"art": [{"amount": 14000, "recorded_at": "2026-03-20T10:24:29.897751+00:00"}]}, "current_prices": {"art": 14000}, "price_range": {"art": {"min": 14000, "max": 14000}}, "links": [{"label": "Misskey_io", "url": "https://misskey.io/@amaruma", "name": "amaruma"}, {"label": "Twitter", "url": "https://x.com/amarumasposts2", "name": "amarumasposts2"}, {"label": "Website", "url": "https://amarumasposts.tumblr.com/", "name": ""}], "flags": {}, "acceptable": true, "works": [{"path": "/@amaruma/works/13", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/dee349b7/uploads/origins/1857fafb-e7be-439d-bee5-3be3f626e771?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c7746b4a9d3ffd51e7b30fa643c969a7", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/dee349b7/uploads/origins/1857fafb-e7be-439d-bee5-3be3f626e771?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c7746b4a9d3ffd51e7b30fa643c969a7, https://si.imgix.net/dee349b7/uploads/origins/1857fafb-e7be-439d-bee5-3be3f626e771?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1dd97d695f599073d2642c82835d40c6 2x, https://si.imgix.net/dee349b7/uploads/origins/1857fafb-e7be-439d-bee5-3be3f626e771?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c83f2aee7068f2880570840131186946 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello Ama~! I would like to request art of a vtuber けいた (keita) https://x.com/keserasera68.\nShe is a vtuber who focuses on singing.\nHer personality is comfy and cheerful.\n\nPlease use \"outfit C 【衣装C】\"\nReference https://keserasera68.fanbox.cc/posts/9080309\n以下、めちゃくちゃ助かること！！\n・可能であれはYouTubeのサムネイル等で使用させて頂きたいので、背景透過verあるとうれしい！\n・データはPNG形式 or psd形式(こっちめちゃくちゃ助かりまくる）\n・左右どちらかの見切れが無い。\n\nThank you ^^\n\nhttps://downloads.fanbox.cc/images/post/9080309/d7Lxhuy27yVe9UIo3FCgmRzN.png", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@amaruma/works/12", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/38ad5855/uploads/origins/2d105d5a-1463-454e-ab8c-07964a6d654f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4e9ee2b9f0cb6553e06d7272540ae947", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/38ad5855/uploads/origins/2d105d5a-1463-454e-ab8c-07964a6d654f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4e9ee2b9f0cb6553e06d7272540ae947, https://si.imgix.net/38ad5855/uploads/origins/2d105d5a-1463-454e-ab8c-07964a6d654f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a1df2c200ab3e217499d53287911e983 2x, https://si.imgix.net/38ad5855/uploads/origins/2d105d5a-1463-454e-ab8c-07964a6d654f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ffea2bb5a0631753c8b6d9d5c61e7734 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは、私はあなたのアートスタイル（特にピンクとブルーのカラフルなもの）が大好きです。\n\n全てはあなた次第ですが、もし本当に鮮やかな色にしてもらえたら嬉しいです！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1Pol_AuDBUTDiGAG2k15RPuvueso0sFoQ?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@amaruma/works/11", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/8bd014c7/uploads/origins/17720c49-8e71-4f02-99a3-439c84387b1e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=051773c049a70a937c61d1b7c217869f", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8bd014c7/uploads/origins/17720c49-8e71-4f02-99a3-439c84387b1e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=051773c049a70a937c61d1b7c217869f, https://si.imgix.net/8bd014c7/uploads/origins/17720c49-8e71-4f02-99a3-439c84387b1e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=590ad0213cfcb521273477022c99b149 2x, https://si.imgix.net/8bd014c7/uploads/origins/17720c49-8e71-4f02-99a3-439c84387b1e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3ed5dcc643de5084bc1c321dbe19b92b 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！君の作品は大好きだよ。色使いも照明も素晴らしい。\n\n私のVtuber、Ligerのイラストを描いていただけませんか？彼はスペースバンパイアの王子様で、とても王族的で威厳があるのですが、独りよがりで高慢でもあります。\n\n詳細はお任せしますので、楽しんで描いてください！SNSに投稿するために使いたいと思います。可能であれば、背景ありバージョンと背景なしバージョンを提供していただけないでしょうか？ご検討のほど、よろしくお願いいたします！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1n_NvJJjyPNetKublIWvy7nA3S-EDX0CA?usp=drive_link", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@amaruma/works/10", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/22822e49/uploads/origins/02a77efa-7fe1-487f-9ed2-eb35b7c279e9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=755e03b9f1eea4ec68c31bdb5daaa249", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/22822e49/uploads/origins/02a77efa-7fe1-487f-9ed2-eb35b7c279e9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=755e03b9f1eea4ec68c31bdb5daaa249, https://si.imgix.net/22822e49/uploads/origins/02a77efa-7fe1-487f-9ed2-eb35b7c279e9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=02ababba7cd82d2ad5f5dca84118e3bb 2x, https://si.imgix.net/22822e49/uploads/origins/02a77efa-7fe1-487f-9ed2-eb35b7c279e9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fec84838e5b06f970ad8eabe29cd79aa 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！Vtuberのアイア・アマーレの3着目の衣装のアートをお願いしたいです。彼女は大天使の騎士です。\nあなたの過去の作品をいくつか見ましたが、あなたの色使いは素晴らしいです！特にhttps://skeb.jp/@amaruma/works/2とhttps://skeb.jp/@amaruma/works/5。\n\nホラーにインスパイアされたような、余分な目を使ったものがいいと思いますが、あなたが思いつくものなら何でも構いません。\n\n参考文献\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1NZrzDbcrwTIGWd6bDI-OqbyQugKZyM4P?usp=sharing\n\n\n私の要望を考慮していただき、ありがとうございます！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@amaruma/works/9", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/58a3a63f/uploads/origins/88f37329-8f1f-4561-9ba7-6a514cb62271?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=144c4fe0f61305390b7a691569700312", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/58a3a63f/uploads/origins/88f37329-8f1f-4561-9ba7-6a514cb62271?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=144c4fe0f61305390b7a691569700312, https://si.imgix.net/58a3a63f/uploads/origins/88f37329-8f1f-4561-9ba7-6a514cb62271?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e2d40e712026213bdba49fd1d0b28868 2x, https://si.imgix.net/58a3a63f/uploads/origins/88f37329-8f1f-4561-9ba7-6a514cb62271?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9de9fa76a3a99aedbd594e4f903ccc91 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは、私のキャラクターに興味を持ってくれてありがとう！あなたの絵はとても美しいので、ぜひイラストを描いていただきたいです。プリンセス・キミレンヌはパステル銀河の王太子妃です。明るくのんびりした性格ですが、時々真面目で、ちょっとヤンデレなところもあります。\nポーズや表情はお任せします。リクエストに応えていただき、ありがとうございました！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1G8ZULqKA6rLO7U1VZIdZldBHCXUxUpas/view?usp=drive_link", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@amaruma/works/8", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/ccd908eb/uploads/origins/9f22af0c-7ebd-46ca-b7fe-90b5dc98aa9d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=91592c013cbed188cde02d119cbe953d", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ccd908eb/uploads/origins/9f22af0c-7ebd-46ca-b7fe-90b5dc98aa9d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=91592c013cbed188cde02d119cbe953d, https://si.imgix.net/ccd908eb/uploads/origins/9f22af0c-7ebd-46ca-b7fe-90b5dc98aa9d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4ca52846052163b04a70067694445255 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ccd908eb/uploads/origins/9f22af0c-7ebd-46ca-b7fe-90b5dc98aa9d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fc9b418b9dfc91483daabacbc123b127 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello Sensei! Saw a lot of your Skebs and the art style is amazing! I would like to have a request for my vtuber oc.\nMy character is an exorcist from the past. she has a flirty, mischievous, smug, sadistic character and she thinks she is the best at everything and does anything she wants.\nplease make her sexy and cute for this!\ninstead of the hair accessories, could you put a headband on her and make the ears like normal cat ears?\nI would like the aesthetic and background to be cute!\nThe pose, expression and outfit is included in the google drive!\nthank you so much!!\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1QJ5HEpkhFu8YqQU1sjRF8__hGkwddztQ?usp=drive_link", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@amaruma/works/7", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/ccb6a288/uploads/origins/fc2e63cb-fb67-4f31-b656-e158152fb0d9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0a72f410983d0c23fd90d132a16de413", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ccb6a288/uploads/origins/fc2e63cb-fb67-4f31-b656-e158152fb0d9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0a72f410983d0c23fd90d132a16de413, https://si.imgix.net/ccb6a288/uploads/origins/fc2e63cb-fb67-4f31-b656-e158152fb0d9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5806a8de0b3fd46db5228598bffafca5 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ccb6a288/uploads/origins/fc2e63cb-fb67-4f31-b656-e158152fb0d9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ea1d24f902967351d53069c987e12679 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは。\n\nモカという名前のOCを描いてほしい。\n\n構図やポーズはお任せします。\n\n用途YouTubeアカウント/ストリーム、Twitterアカウント、動画などで使用する可能性があります。\n\n参考\nhttps://1drv.ms/f/s!ArB9hx8odCgug21bNls_n8lDZLv5?e=VlEz6z", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@amaruma/